# Auth
# NOTE: these were regenerated from the literal "change_this_to_..."
# placeholders that shipped in the previous .env -- those were never safe
# to run with (anyone could forge admin tokens knowing the placeholder
# text). These are internal app secrets, not a third-party credential, so
# they're safe to rotate; swap them for your own values any time.
